 potential of adult human mesenchymal stem cells</article-title><source>Science</source><volume>284</volume><fpage>143</fpage><lpage>147</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10102814</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b34-ijn-2-253"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Poncharal</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>ZL</given-names></name><name><surname>Ugarte</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>1999</year><article-title>Electrostatic deflections and electromechanical resonances of carbon nanotubes</article-title><source>Science</source><volume>283</volume><fpage>1513</fpage><lpage>1517</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10066169</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b35-ijn-2-253"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ren</surname><given-names>ZF</given-names></name><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>ZP</given-names></name><name><surname>Xu</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>1998</year><article-title>Synthesis of large arrays of well-aligned carbon nanotubes on glass</article-title><source>Science</source><volume>282</volume><fpage>1105</fpage><lpage>1107</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9804545</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b36-ijn-2-253"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sharma</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Elisseeff</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Engineering structurally organized cartilage and bone tissues</article-title><source>Annals of Biomedical Engineering</source><volume>32</volume><fpage>148</fpage><lpage>159</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14964730</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b37-ijn-2-253"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surna